## Final answer

Summarize in a short report:
- the task as defined (entity, target, time point, horizon, metric) and the split method,
- data issues found and how they were cleaned,
{% if guardrails %}- leakage: which features were removed and why, and anything still uncertain,
{% endif %}- model comparison (baseline vs chosen, CV mean ± std) and why this model,
- held-out test results vs baseline, and whether the result can be trusted (and why),
- top drivers from the explanation,
- where the exported artifacts are (model card, train.py, score.py).

